{
  "schemas": [
    {
      "dhis2Type": "dataElement",
      "required": ["name", "shortName", "valueType", "domainType", "categoryCombo"],
      "forbidden": ["lastUpdated", "href", "id", "access"],
      "controlableFields": [
        "name",
        "shortName",
        "description",
        "formName",
        "displayFormName",
        "valueType",
        "domainType",
        "aggregationType",
        "optionSet",
        "categoryComboUid",
        "zeroStorageType"
      ],
      "properties": {}
    },
    {
      "dhis2Type": "optionSet",
      "required": ["name"],
      "forbidden": ["lastUpdated", "href", "id", "access"],
      "controlableFields": ["name", "description", "version", "optionCount", "code", "nameLocale"],
      "properties": {}
    },
    {
      "dhis2Type": "program",
      "required": ["name", "programType"],
      "forbidden": ["lastUpdated", "href", "id", "access"],
      "controlableFields": [
        "name",
        "shortName",
        "description",
        "programType",
        "selectIncidentDatesInFuture",
        "useFirstStageDuringRegistration",
        "displayFrontPage",
        "accessLevel"
      ],
      "properties": {}
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "本文件是**离线基线**：required 与 controlableFields 的权威来源是实例自身的 /api/schemas",
    "（0.2 权威顺序第 1、2 条）。capability/probe.py 会按发现范围同步并写入 CAPABILITY_PROFILE",
    "产物，S2 读的永远是合成后的产物，不是这里（DX-CAP-003：禁止运行时猜测）。",
    "properties 留空即表示“由实例补齐”；forbidden 是 DX-EXE-040 读回比对时不比较的字段。"
  ]
}
